</span></span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.4.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;" rowspan="3"><span id="S4.T1.4.6.2.1" class="ltx_text">
<span id="S4.T1.4.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block">
<span id="S4.T1.4.6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">4</span>
